  m_text: 'Left Mouse to shoot arrows - u can collect them

    Right Mouse to dash
    (consumes 15 energy, deals damage, immunity window)

    Space in air to hover
    (consumes energy) on ground to jump

    Red cubes are enemies, they deal damage
    on contact

    Red capsules on walls are spikes - they deal damage

    Orange
    cubes restore energy when inside them'
